  "label": "Shyness in Online Context",
  "description": "The phrase 'I'm shy, but I like stuff' is a humorous and self-deprecating way to describe the internal conflict of wanting to engage with content or communities online but being hesitant to participate due to social anxiety or fear of judgment. This is a common stereotype or self-identification among internet users.",
